{"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_0468C0","resource_class":"BRIEFING_NBE","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":0,"cn_text":"伪装成矿场的基地吗。我们也没到过那么远。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":60,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":1,"cn_text":"不知道那里是什么地方，总之你要小心。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":54,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":2,"cn_text":"明白。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":9,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":3,"cn_text":"还有传闻说，美军把外星人的尸体和回收的<R=未确认飞行物体,UFO>藏在秘密基地里。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=未确认飞行物体,UFO>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":110,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":4,"cn_text":"外星人？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":12,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":5,"cn_text":"宇宙中有无数星球。应该认为，那些文明比我们先进的星球居民，会乘UFO来到地球。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":111,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":6,"cn_text":"实际上，美军曾宣布，他们在1947年于罗斯威尔附近回收了一架飞碟。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":91,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":7,"cn_text":"Snake你可能不知道，不过这在美军里可是很有名的事！","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":71,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":8,"cn_text":"这样啊……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":18,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":9,"cn_text":"总之，他们也许还藏着我们不知道的武器。小心点。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":69,"review_flag":""}]}